= Foundations =

BITwiki is guided by three complementary foundational writings. Together, they establish its philosophical orientation, purpose, and enduring commitments.

Each addresses a different question. None is a substitute for the others.

== Foundational writings ==

{| class="wikitable"
! Writing !! Central question !! Purpose
|-
| [[BITwiki:Manifesto|Manifesto]] || '''Why does BITwiki exist?''' || A declaration of purpose and direction, confronting the conditions of the world in which knowledge and intelligence must develop.
